<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38664" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prō-gĕro</span></b> , gessi,
			gestum, 3, v. a.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To carry forth</i> or <i>out</i>, <i>to clear out</i>, <i>cast out</i>
			(post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">defunctas (apes),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 18, 20, § 63</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">formicae ova progerentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					18, 35, 88, § 364</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fimum stabulis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					1, 6, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">urcei, quibus oleum progeritur,</span>”
				i.e. <i>is laded out</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 50, 80</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To carry before</i>, <i>bear in
			front</i> (post-class.), <i><span class="en">App. M. 11, p. 264,
				35</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">divinas effigies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib.</span></i>
			 p. 265, 11.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
